# Beside a second root, the primary root's header names its folder the
# way the added root's does — not its absolute path, which the stock
# sidebar cut to `● /Use…` next to `○ extra` (src/app/tree.zig,
# `primaryName`). Alone, the header still names the whole path.
write a.txt "a\n"
write extra/lib/c.txt "c\n"
command view.focus_tree
command view.add_workspace
type extra
key enter
expect screen contains "workspace added: extra"
expect screen contains " ○ extra"
expect screen contains " ● "
expect screen lacks " ● /"
expect screen lacks " ● ~"
